<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: #f5f5f5; padding: 40px 0; }
    .container { max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 32px; }
    h1 { font-size: 20px; color: #1a1a2e; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    p { font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 12px; }
    .footer { margin-top: 24px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>SMTP Configuration Successful</h1>
    <p>This is a test email from <strong>Weaver</strong>. If you are reading this, your SMTP settings are working correctly.</p>
    <p>Sent to: <strong>{{email}}</strong></p>
    <div class="footer">This email was sent by Weaver to verify your SMTP configuration.</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
